      "statement":"Reduce coupling by dependency shape, not file count alone. The preferred displayed direction is carriers -> semantic kernels -> effect shells -> projections, rather than controllers -> service helpers -> mutable runtime state -> projections. Excess coupling includes many modules reading/mutating one object, projections inferring truth from implementation state, consumers silently rebuilding source truth from raw artifacts, or tests passing only because multiple modules duplicate meaning. Reduction means fewer places where meaning can be invented.",
